---
export const lang = 'en';
export const slug = 'location';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout lang={lang} slug={slug} title="How to get there | Torre de Mejanell">
  <main class="bg-[#fcfbf9] text-[#1f1a17] overflow-x-hidden">
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#7a5a3d]">How to get there</p>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-[#1f1a17]">Getting to Torre de Mejanell</h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-[#6b5f56] leading-relaxed">
              We are located in the Segarra region, just a few minutes from Cervera and about an hour from major cities such as Lleida or Manresa.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e5dcd0] bg-white p-8 shadow-sm space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-[#1f1a17]">Directions</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#6b5f56] list-disc pl-5">
              <li>From Cervera: approximately 20 minutes by car.</li>
              <li>From Lleida: approximately 1 hour via the C-25.</li>
              <li>From Barcelona: approximately 1 hour and 45 minutes.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e5dcd0] bg-[#f6efe4] p-8 shadow-sm">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-serif text-[#1f1a17]">Practical details</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#6b5f56]">
              Access is straightforward and the house has private parking. If you prefer, we recommend arriving a little early to enjoy the landscape as you enter.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden border border-[#e5dcd0] shadow-md h-[460px]">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2975.3526685805566!2d1.327915576135805!3d41.77708517124976!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x12a47e0034685351%3A0x400fa7d02844520!2s25215%20Estar%C3%A0s%2C%20Lleida!5e0!3m2!1ses!2ses!4v1717000000000!5m2!1ses!2ses"
            width="100%"
            height="100%"
            style="border:0;"
            allowfullscreen=""
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
